  "implemented": [
    "Product OfficeHost exports a closed descriptor from the actual SDK environment calculation.",
    "Cloud Worker has an isolated descriptor command that needs no database, telemetry or model configuration.",
    "Candidate backend validates a pinned regular descriptor file with a 4096-byte limit and closed typed fields.",
    "Automatic candidate upload creates the original native policy /3; stable stays /2.",
    "New invalid-environment requests save no source or job; accepted idempotent requests reuse their original policy without rediscovery.",
